#
# easy — accessible native PC/QEMU kernel configuration
#
# Goals:
#   - boots standalone (no remote file server / bootp)
#   - prints a friendly console banner (easyinit)
#   - works under QEMU with rtl8139 or pcnet NIC
#   - keeps a small embedded root for first-run demos
#
# Build:  cd os/pc && mk CONF=easy install
# Image:  tools/bootable/mkbootimg.sh
#

